[h1]Description:[/h1]
This is a mod I created for players to customize their pylons on Planes, Helicopter and UAV's. Pylon Manger is dynamic so it should work with any plane or helicopter mod as well.

[h1]How to use:[/h1]
The action will show up when sitting in a vehicle or looking at a vehicle.

To change something in the Pylon Configuration just double click what you want it to be switched too.

[h1]Cfg Example[/h1]
This goes in the Description.ext

class CfgPylonManager
{
	//Blacklisted Magazines
	blacklistedMagazines[] = {"PylonMissile_Missile_AMRAAM_D_INT_x1","PylonRack_Bomb_SDB_x4"};

	//Nothing is rearm everywhere
	rearmObjects[] = {"B_Slingload_01_Ammo_F","B_Truck_01_ammo_F"};

	//Distance needed from rearmObjects[]
	rearmRange = 20;
};


